Ancel
=====

*"It is most unfortunate that you have seen me. Oh well, it can't be helped. Good-bye."*

*A twelve-year-old pianist who is secretly a hitman.*

**Background**

Ancel looks like an ordinary twelve-year-old boy, but anyone who
spends time with him notices something deeper: a composure,
insight, and self-supporting life as a pianist that don't fit his
age. Playing piano is only his cover. He's a hitman, equipped with
every kind of weapon and gadget and very good at the job. Clients
never meet him, targets never survive him, and his youthful look
is the ideal disguise. Nobody knows his past.

**Character Hooks**

Anyone who angers the wrong person might find Ancel sent after
them, and the PCs might try to stop him finishing a job. Or he
might just be a friendly face at the local café or bar.

